Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:18:28 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 43/54] fix: bots no longer hang in the air in the Ring of
 Valor

Bots never really ride the opening elevators: some are carried with a
wrong offset and end ~7 yd above the floor, and the core only re-grounds
players that are not falling, a flag a client-less bot can keep. The arena
trigger is now "off arena floor" (Dalaran Sewers pipes or a Ring of Valor
hang) and arena tactics drops a hanging bot onto the floor or pillar below.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vn4vD1fiBmsMGCCvsiqU7z
